  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288289 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288290 13194139534439 true] [17592186288289 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288291 13194139534439 true] [17592186288289 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534439 true] [17592186288289 1041 "field-1" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288289 1104 #edb/ref 17592186288290 13194139534439 true] [17592186288289 1110 #uuid "59adba1c-cab2-5d55-8e88-ff1488affea9" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288290 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288290 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534439 true] [17592186288290 1111 #uuid "9d2ea12a-1c77-57bc-a37d-1f1d2df90d03" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288291 1034 "1" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288291 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534439 true] [17592186288291 1111 #uuid "e52d3b22-a3be-59e0-95d5-e5d23247e714" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288292 1017 #edb/ref 17592186288293 13194139534439 true] [17592186288292 1089 "q-352697" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288292 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534439 true] [17592186288292 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}(1+{cot}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288292 1113 #uuid "47c77dff-cf5e-5b99-9aa2-2dee7408c956" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288292 1145 "We use the cosecant-cotangent identity:\n\n$$\n1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}(1+{cot}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})) \\\\  & =-0-(-1) \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288293 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288294 13194139534439 true] [17592186288293 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534439 true] [17592186288293 1041 "field-1" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288293 1104 #edb/ref 17592186288294 13194139534439 true] [17592186288293 1110 #uuid "8d7e44b5-3fa9-5fef-bbf9-f56e43f84dcc" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288294 1034 "1" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288294 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534439 true] [17592186288294 1111 #uuid "238c1871-f4c1-5c75-9465-ff1451c1a319" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288295 1017 #edb/ref 17592186288296 13194139534439 true] [17592186288295 1089 "q-352714" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288295 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534439 true] [17592186288295 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{1-{cos}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{4})}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288295 1113 #uuid "844ead48-86d3-5441-9336-ed5d8fea3ef1" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288295 1145 "From the identity $1-{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta $ with $\\theta =x+\\frac{\\pi }{4},$ we get \n\n$$\n1-{cos}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{4})={sin}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{4}).\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{1-{cos}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{4})}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{4})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{csc}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\frac{\\pi }{4})-[-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(0+\\frac{\\pi }{4})] \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})+\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =-0+1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534439 true] [17592186288296 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288297 13194139534439 true] [17592186288296 1040 #edb/ref